    {
      "id": "AATKC-2Vcy3msVSxefsCK",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2350.097331207944,
      "y": 2590.5670871070984,
      "width": 640.4910603264617,
      "height": 575,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0m",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1961890409,
      "version": 693,
      "versionNonce": 1106699401,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790915835740,
      "created": 1790915443816,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "POD PHASE\n- Pending\nwhen a pod is being accepted \nex: still schedualing the pod \nor the image is still downloading\n\n- Running \nthe pod has been bound to a node \natleast on of the containers is running \n\n- Succeeded\na job will run for a minute and finish\nall containers in the pod have terminated successfully with an\nexit code of 0 and will not be restarted\n\n- Failed\nwhen a pod ends with a error code, non zero exit code\n\n- Unkown\nthe cluster cant obtain the pods status\ncant determine the phase the pod is currently in\nusually duo to communication loss between the control plane and\nthe node",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "POD PHASE\n- Pending\nwhen a pod is being accepted \nex: still schedualing the pod \nor the image is still downloading\n\n- Running \nthe pod has been bound to a node \natleast on of the containers is running \n\n- Succeeded\na job will run for a minute and finish\nall containers in the pod have terminated successfully with an exit code of 0 and will not be restarted\n\n- Failed\nwhen a pod ends with a error code, non zero exit code\n\n- Unkown\nthe cluster cant obtain the pods status\ncant determine the phase the pod is currently in\nusually duo to communication loss between the control plane and the node",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "GPZr51Xb5W7PjyQj1Z9zT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3089.4475069541486,
      "y": 2586.299890909554,
      "width": 575.0872662997801,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0n",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 811470535,
      "version": 453,
      "versionNonce": 1104326153,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790916109391,
      "created": 1790915842142,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CONTAINER STATE\n- Waiting\ndefault initial state where the container is still executing\nrequired startup setup operations\nthe container runtime might be pulling the image from the\nimage registry, configuring network namespaces, applying\nsecret\n\n- Running\ncontainer executing without issues\n\n- Terminated\nthe main process inside the container has finished running \nwither its succeeded or failed ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CONTAINER STATE\n- Waiting\ndefault initial state where the container is still executing required startup setup operations\nthe container runtime might be pulling the image from the image registry, configuring network namespaces, applying secret\n\n- Running\ncontainer executing without issues\n\n- Terminated\nthe main process inside the container has finished running \nwither its succeeded or failed ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
