      "created": 1790999487099,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "abdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl get pods -o wide\nNAME                                  READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE     IP           NODE                         NOMINATED\nNODE   READINESS GATES\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-5t4kk   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.2.5   multi-node-cluster-worker    <none>\n<none>\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-ch7zc   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.2.4   multi-node-cluster-worker    <none>\n<none>\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-trshc   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.1.3   multi-node-cluster-worker2   <none>\n<none>",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "abdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl get pods -o wide\nNAME                                  READY   STATUS    RESTARTS   AGE     IP           NODE                         NOMINATED NODE   READINESS GATES\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-5t4kk   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.2.5   multi-node-cluster-worker    <none>           <none>\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-ch7zc   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.2.4   multi-node-cluster-worker    <none>           <none>\nbackend-deployment-6f5f998878-trshc   1/1     Running   0          6m25s   10.244.1.3   multi-node-cluster-worker2   <none>           <none>",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "JCEhqIydbgSWtFQiSSpeu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6154.30522017284,
      "y": 2391.50563611137,
      "width": 1151.4341517857144,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2u",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1949699408,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 1550741328,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791000422281,
      "created": 1790999507964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "abdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl apply -f service/backend-service.yaml \nabdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl get endpointslices\nNAME                       ADDRESSTYPE   PORTS   ENDPOINTS                          AGE\nbackend-service-cqr42   IPv4                 8080     10.244.2.4,10.244.2.5,10.244.1.3   5m43s\nkubernetes                 IPv4                 6443      172.21.0.3                            24h",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "abdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl apply -f service/backend-service.yaml \nabdelrahman@debian:~/k8s-series$ kubectl get endpointslices\nNAME                       ADDRESSTYPE   PORTS   ENDPOINTS                          AGE\nbackend-service-cqr42   IPv4                 8080     10.244.2.4,10.244.2.5,10.244.1.3   5m43s\nkubernetes                 IPv4                 6443      172.21.0.3                            24h",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "lQFB_pgE7HikUOTGvS9VP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6154.422407672847,
      "y": 2567.8393414685124,
      "width": 1265.6863839285706,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2007742896,
      "version": 144,
      "versionNonce": 696517968,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791000422281,
      "created": 1790999664324,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- A Service gives a group of pods one stable network identity (a fixed IP and DNS name), so clients don't need to know which\nindividual pods exist or what their IPs are.\n- Pods are temporary. When they crash, scale, or get replaced, their IPs change. A Service sits in front of them and stays\nconstant while the pods behind it come and go\n- You create a Service with a label selector\n- Kubernetes continuously finds all ready pods matching that label and records their IPs in an EndpointSlice.\n- Kubernetes runs its own DNS server inside the cluster (CoreDNS), and it automatically creates DNS records for every Service\n- DNS name format: <service-name>.<namespace>.svc.<cluster-domain>\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- A Service gives a group of pods one stable network identity (a fixed IP and DNS name), so clients don't need to know which individual pods exist or what their IPs are.\n- Pods are temporary. When they crash, scale, or get replaced, their IPs change. A Service sits in front of them and stays constant while the pods behind it come and go\n- You create a Service with a label selector\n- Kubernetes continuously finds all ready pods matching that label and records their IPs in an EndpointSlice.\n- Kubernetes runs its own DNS server inside the cluster (CoreDNS), and it automatically creates DNS records for every Service\n- DNS name format: <service-name>.<namespace>.svc.<cluster-domain>\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
