      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791009915066,
      "created": 1791009362294,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- ConfigMaps and Secrets both inject configuration into pods so you don't bake settings\ninto the container image\n- A ConfigMap is for non-sensitive data, and a Secret is for sensitive data\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- ConfigMaps and Secrets both inject configuration into pods so you don't bake settings into the container image\n- A ConfigMap is for non-sensitive data, and a Secret is for sensitive data\n",
